> Hmmm...I seem to remember one [s] lycanthrope ascension in which a
> fellow drank vampire blood to become a no-timeout vampire, then nurse
> danced to raise his double-digit max HP. Could such as thing be done
> playing a nymph (hopefully wearing an amulet of unchanging)? Has
